@startmindmap tools
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
title The 22 MCP tools
* total-recall
** Write
*** store_memory\norg tag → org vault · force = supersede
*** update_memory\norg: author-guarded
*** delete_memory\nno-prune needs force
*** confirm_memory\n±10% retention
** Bulk
*** export_memories\nunreadable → {key, error} [TR-W7]
*** import_memories\nskips error entries
*** delete_memories\nconfirm=true · per-key errors
** Search / read
*** recall_memory\nTF-IDF × decay (+ vector RRF)
*** search_index\nmetadata only, no access bump
*** get_memories_by_keys\nthrough LRU cache
*** rerank_memories\ncosine, ≤ 200 keys [TR-P1]
left side
** List / query
*** list_memories
*** get_related_memories\nJaccard tags (+ elements)
*** get_timeline
*** get_stats\nvector.enabled via depsInstalled()
** Maintenance
*** rebuild_index\nkeeps access stats · forceReembed
*** prune_memories\nlists only, never deletes
** Architecture (specDriven)
*** index_architecture
*** get_architecture_context
*** trace
*** get_architecture_history
*** validate_architecture
@endmindmap
